  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1302.11 “Roster year” is the period beginning June 30th of the submitting year until September 15th of the following year",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1302.11 “Roster year” is the period beginning June 30th of the submitting year until September 15th of the following year. The most current submitted roster supersedes all prior June rosters submitted.\n\nSource. #14005, eff 6-22-24, EXPIRES: 6-22-34 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1300)",
